@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequence {
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 ParticipantBorderColor black
 LifeLineBorderColor black
 LifeLineBackgroundColor white
 ArrowColor black
 GroupBackgroundColor white
 GroupBorderColor black
}
actor "收费人员" as A0
boundary "<u>:收费人员接口</u>" as B0
actor "诊所负责人" as A1
boundary "<u>:诊所负责人接口</u>" as B1
control "<u>:登记供应商付款</u>\n<u>与结算控制</u>" as K
participant "<u>:采购</u>" as Purchase
participant "<u>:验收</u>" as Receipt
participant "<u>:供应商资金</u>" as SupplierFunds
participant "<u>:供货付款</u>" as SupplyPayment
participant "<u>:供货分配</u>" as SupplyAllocation
participant "工作单元" as W
participant "数据映射器" as DM
participant "权限与会话服务" as AUTH
A0 -> B0 : 提交线下实际付款结果
activate B0
B0 -> B0 : 检查输入格式()
B0 -> K : 办理(ctx, UC29Command)
activate K
group 本阶段同一写事务
K -> W : 开始写事务()
W --> K : 同一连接
K -> AUTH : 核对岗位及对象(ctx, 引用)
AUTH --> K : 有效授权依据或拒绝
K -> W : 核对提交(ctx, cmd)
W --> K : 新命令分支（原结果短路见公共图）
K -> DM : 装载(对象引用、连接)
DM --> K : 实体与依据快照
K -> SupplierFunds : 核实实际付款(渠道、实际结果及凭据)
activate SupplierFunds
SupplierFunds -> SupplyPayment : 确认实际支出(已核实结果)
activate SupplyPayment
SupplyPayment -> SupplyAllocation : 形成供货分配(采购预付或验收结算)
activate SupplyAllocation
SupplyAllocation --> SupplyPayment : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate SupplyAllocation
SupplyPayment --> SupplierFunds : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate SupplyPayment
SupplierFunds --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate SupplierFunds
alt 本阶段全部校验通过
K -> DM : 保存(变更集合、连接)
DM --> K : 保存成功或版本冲突
K -> W : 校验集合与来源()
W --> K : 末校验结果
K -> W : 保存结果与审计并提交()
else 任一步骤拒绝或保存失败
K -> W : 回滚()
end
end
K --> B0 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B0 --> A0 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B0
note over K,SupplyAllocation
校验不通过时返回规约中的原因；
本阶段不留下部分有效结果。
end note

@enduml
